# "ночы" reads on the am half of the 12-hour clock ("а другой ночы" is
# 02:00). Over an explicit 24-hour clock it keeps 18:00-23:59 as written
# ("23:30 ночы"), the same as ru "ночи". No dictionary entry found pins this
# either way. 13:00-17:59 is the afternoon, so "15:30 ночы" names no time.
ночы
